<title>JAPAN: Sharp Corp develops world's largest advanced LCD.</title>
<headline>Sharp Corp develops world's largest advanced LCD.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharp Corp announced on Friday that it has developed the world's largest thin film transistor liquid crystal display (TFT-LCD).</p>
<p>The size of the newly developed TFT-LCD is 82 centimetres by 1.04 metres, the company said.</p>
<p>TFT-LCD panels are the most most advanced display panels for personal computers and other information equipment.</p>
</text>
